<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Prime TV eyes acquisition options.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Prime TV eyes acquisition options.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regional broadcaster Prime Television Ltd said on Monday it continued to actively consider acquisition opportunities and that it was well poised to benefit from any upswing in national advertising markets.</p>
</text>
